  "description": "The Pinnacle Laterite 3 is engineered for comfort, control and confidence, making it an ideal choice for riders looking to take their road cycling to the next level. Its lightweight 6061 heat treated aluminium frame delivers a responsive yet stable ride, while the carbon-bladed fork helps smooth out road vibrations for improved comfort on longer journeys. Thoughtful finishing touches like thicker bar tape further enhance ride quality, making it well suited to everything from steady training rides to longer weekend miles.\n\nEquipped with Shimano’s reliable Sora 2x9 drivetrain, the Laterite 3 offers smooth, consistent shifting across a wide gear range, helping you tackle varied terrain with ease. Tektro dual pivot caliper brakes provide dependable stopping power, while Schwalbe Lugano 700x25C tyres deliver a balance of speed and grip on the road. Built with practicality and progression in mind, it’s a dependable road bike for riders building confidence and distance.",
